msgid "启动契约"
msgstr "Boot Contract"

msgid "固件与交接"
msgstr "Firmware and Handoff"

msgid ""
"同一 kernel.sys 包含 Multiboot2 BIOS 32 位入口与 EFI64 入口。 BIOS 入口检查 CPU 能力、建立页表与栈后进入共享 64 位内核。 "
"解析交接数据时检查边界、对齐、长度和溢出；EFI 信息指针保留完整宽度。 固件、GRUB 与模块载荷需满足该协议，本仓不生成 ISO 或安装引导器。"
msgstr ""
"The same kernel.sys contains both a Multiboot2 BIOS 32-bit entry and an EFI64 entry. The BIOS "
"entry checks CPU capabilities and sets up page tables and a stack before entering the shared "
"64-bit kernel. Handoff data parsing checks bounds, alignment, lengths, and overflow; EFI "
"information pointers retain their full width. Firmware, GRUB, and module payloads must satisfy "
"this protocol. This repository does not generate an ISO or install a bootloader."

msgid "根分区"
msgstr "Root Partition"

msgid ""
"设备发现后解析显式 ``root=PARTUUID=...``，匹配唯一 GPT 分区身份。 畸形、缺失或重复请求拒绝自动回退；连接顺序不能替代指定身份。 "
"旧自动发现行为与显式选择是不同路线。内核映像和引导模块的内存范围 在物理内存管理初始化前保留，不能当作可重用空闲页。"
msgstr ""
"After device discovery, an explicit ``root=PARTUUID=...`` is parsed to match a unique GPT "
"partition identity. Malformed, missing, or duplicate requests reject automatic fallback; "
"connection order cannot replace the specified identity. Legacy automatic discovery and explicit "
"selection are separate paths. Memory ranges occupied by the kernel image and boot modules are "
"reserved before physical memory management is initialized and must not be treated as reusable free"
" pages."

msgid "日志"
msgstr "Logging"

msgid ""
"启动日志可镜像到 COM1。``logcolor=0`` 关闭内核颜色，``bootlog-pause=1`` 在启动检查点等待输入；普通启动继续进入用户态。文字控制台采用现有 "
"framebuffer 字形、pitch 和原生 RGB 转换，不假设紧密排列的 32 位像素。"
msgstr ""
"Boot logs can be mirrored to COM1. ``logcolor=0`` disables kernel colors, and ``bootlog-pause=1`` "
"waits for input at boot checkpoints; normal boot proceeds into userspace. The text console uses "
"the existing framebuffer glyphs, pitch, and native RGB conversion, without assuming tightly packed"
" 32-bit pixels."
